of GDDR6X memory is a welcome upgrade

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:41.640
as we continue to watch VRAM usage in modern games

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:45.100
go from unreasonable to downright idiotic.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.940
To quantify our excitement then,

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:51.940
the lab performed a whopping 984 tests across 11 GPUs

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.020
with CPUs from both Intel and AMD.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.600
We're gonna have links down below.

