00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.960
Now it's worth noting that the 4070

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:59.000
has some non-gaming generational advantages.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.280
It's new so it'll have driver support for longer

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.720
